    "result": "I implemented `encode` and `decode` in `solution.py` following `spec.md`, keeping the stub signatures. `encode` scans maximal runs and writes runs of four or more as `~n~c`, with `~` escaped as `~~` otherwise. `decode` reads left to right, handles `~~` and `~n~c`, and raises `ValueError` for a dangling `~`, a non-digit after `~`, leading zeros, a count below 4, a count not followed by `~`, or a missing character. I wrote `tests/test_solution.py` with examples, round-trip cases, maximal-run checks and malformed inputs. `python -m pytest -q tests` passes: 48 tests, no failures.",
